        <mxCell id="21" value="1. User opens https://synchem.salestrip.in/" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="88" width="230" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" value="▸ What
  Load Synchem tenant URL in browser.

▸ Who
  Admin, Manager, MR

▸ Example
  https://synchem.salestrip.in/" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="86" width="330" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" value="2. Browser loads AngularJS app + DevExtreme + AdminLTE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="146" width="230" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" value="▸ What
  SPA bootstraps UI shell and route config.

▸ Who
  Browser (client)

▸ Data
  317 UI routes · 146 menu screens" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="144" width="330" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" value="3. Enter Username + Password + Company Code SYN" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="204" width="230" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" value="▸ What
  Collect login credentials on login form.

▸ Who
  End user

▸ API / Screen
  #/app/login

▸ Data
  compCode = SYN (Synchem)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="202" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" value="4. POST /token (OAuth2 password grant)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="262" width="230" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="28" value="▸ What
  Exchange credentials for JWT access token.

▸ Who
  Angular authService

▸ API / Screen
  POST /token

▸ Data
  username={user},SYN" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="260" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
