        <mxCell id="32" value="▸ What
  Send session payload to client.

▸ Who
  Server

▸ Data
  146 menus · SET001–SET131 flags · empId · roleType" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="390" width="330" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
